### 27 - Save quiz answer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/quiz-attempts/{{attemptId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{traineeAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: vi

{
  "answers": [
    {"questionId": {{questionId}}, "selectedAnswersJson": ["@Valid"]}
  ]
}

### 28 - Submit quiz
POST {{baseUrl}}/quiz-attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{traineeAccessToken}}
Accept-Language: vi

### 29 - Review submitted result
GET {{baseUrl}}/quiz-attempts/{{attemptId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{traineeAccessToken}}
Accept-Language: vi

### 30 - Trainee performs QR check-in
POST {{baseUrl}}/training-sessions/{{sessionId}}/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{traineeAccessToken}}
Accept-Language: vi

### 31 - Admin completes session after attendance exists
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/training-sessions/{{sessionId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: vi

{"status": "Completed"}

